  bareMetalEnabled    Boolean   @default(false) @map("bare_metal_enabled")
  // KYC / billing profile (bare-metal term-prepay, legal/finance mandate).
  // Keyed by the operating account's stripe_customer_id; replaces the fragile
  // company-in-Stripe-metadata store (PA-231). Nullable; "N/A" allowed in
  // company fields. companyName supersedes legacy customer.metadata.company.
